  "notes": "USAGE:\nUsed as a noun or suru verb. Do not confuse with the homophone {復習|ふくしゅう} (review, revision of studies), which has the same reading but completely different meaning and kanji.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {復讐|ふくしゅう}を{誓|ちか}う: to vow revenge\n- {復讐|ふくしゅう}を{果|は}たす: to carry out one's revenge\n- {復讐|ふくしゅう}に{燃|も}える: to burn with desire for revenge\n- {復讐|ふくしゅう}{劇|げき}: revenge drama",
